ontrol a cute girl and move forward.<br />\nIt's not difficult, but there are many respawn points to help you.<br />\n<br />\nUse movement, dashing, jumping, crouching, wall climbing, and more to move forward.<br />\nPick up balls along the way to update your respawn point to that point, and advance to the checkpoint to unlock an emote.<br />\n<br />\nThere is also a hard mode where there are no respawn points.<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nIf it's too easy, please let us know your thoughts in the review.<br />\nWe've kept the difficulty low because we want you to reach the goal rather than give up on the game halfway through because of an unreasonable difficulty.<br />\n<br />\nProduced by: DeepLoad<br />\nTwitter:<a href=\"https://twitter.com/deepload2018\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/deepload2018</a>"}]}], "description": "よくある上に登っていくシンプルな3Dアクションゲームです。", "short_introduction": "よくある上に登っていくシンプルな3Dアクションゲームです。", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01324426.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794949461}